          "num": 1,
          "title": "Bedanya GENERAL dan CONDITION?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **GENERAL** — 3 langkah, untuk aturan sederhana\n• **CONDITION** — 4 langkah (+ Use Condition), untuk aturan kompleks\n• Pilih GENERAL dulu kalau baru belajar",
          "color": "#f97316",
          "bg": "#fff7ed",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fed7aa;overflow:hidden;padding:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:11px;border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffbeb,#fff);overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;font-size:10px;color:#475569;text-align:center;\">3 langkah</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:11px;border:1.5px solid #7c3aed;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f5f3ff,#fff);overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;font-size:10px;color:#475569;text-align:center;\">4 langkah<span style=\"display:block;font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;\">+ Use Condition</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Kenapa tombol Next tidak aktif?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Ada field wajib yang belum diisi\n• Cek: Rule Name, Risk Score, dan validasi error merah\n• Kalau semua sudah benar, tombol akan aktif",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;\">Validasi Error</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "History undo/redo berapa lama?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Menyimpan **50 langkah** terakhir\n• Setiap aksi (tambah/hapus/pindah/edit) = 1 langkah",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;justify-content:center;\"><kbd style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;font-size:12px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Ctrl+Z</kbd><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:6px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:#eef2ff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">50 langkah</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Copy node antar rule?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Bisa!** Ctrl+C di Rule A, Ctrl+V di Rule B\n• Semua konfigurasi ikut tersalin",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdfa,#fff);border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#f0fdfa;border:1.5px solid #14b8a6;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Rule A</div><kbd style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:10px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:600;\">Ctrl+C</kbd><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><kbd style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:10px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:600;\">Ctrl+V</kbd><div style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#f0fdfa;border:1.5px solid #14b8a6;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Rule B</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
